{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2","id":5011823840,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVXP_H88AAAABKrpc4A","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/statuses/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"阶段2：准入写故障、主表完整性和元数据范围修复（WR-22至24）","user":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"独立复验固定 ea6053e 后，原 WR-20、WR-21 触发场景修复后通过；但准入写故障会把新任务降为旧协议（WR-23/P1），老SID映射更新后全部流动性缺失可被第201名补位（WR-22/P2）。WR-24/P3记录当前元数据混入旧轮描述。本批修复这三项，**待新固定版本独立复验，模块和阶段2整体仍未通过**。\n\n## 固定版本及复审\n\n- 本次源码：`ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6`\n- [GPT Work独立复审指令](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6/audit/review_packages/wr22_wr24/README.md)\n- [修复说明](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6/docs/review/wr22-wr24.md)、[开发验证及身份](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6/audit/review_packages/wr22_wr24/developer_verification.json)\n- [原独立正式报告](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6/audit/reviews/20261027-ea6053e-windows/formal_report.txt)、[原件归档校验](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ccad61d03ccf17bf2bdc2d7ffc88dfd11b6d3ca6/audit/ea6053e_review_archive_check.json)\n- source清单：`0467707062f8f37d4a827e10fede9dd71a24ae7fc21980be93020d06bf3e7327`\n- 稳定execution清单：`f54d4ffa640d9a6024134f2c152c0bcc69633c9ba65a1a445b691a9ecdea8aed`\n\n## 最终变更\n\n- **WR-23：** 新Research的完整entry协议身份与admission在同一不可变记录发布。后续entry写失败也不能退回legacy；恢复不盲补marker，缺完整协议或dispatch时成功/失败结算均拒绝。每attempt的独立prepare锁串行首次发布；明确历史四字段admission和原f5d sidecar兼容保持。\n- **WR-22：** 从形成时可知的完整主表连续历史判断永久SID的历史义务，映射更新不重置IPO，义务独立于liquidity是否还存在。断档、重叠、未知历史或当前分类不足不会借补位通过；明确未上市/ETF排除和原listing-clock兼容保持，WR-20的上市前过滤及原refs/raw/count不变。\n- **WR-24：** 旧描述逐字移入带ea基线/7fc云端身份的historical对象。当前零新增/零平台读取及9个实际变更Python路径由只读 `tools/review_metadata.py` 核对固定Git差异、历史描述、源码清单及预算/账本原字节。此程序不认证外部活动或授予验收。\n\n## 已执行的开发验证\n\n- `python -B tools/research.py build`、`python -B tools/stages.py verify` 成功，最终冻结源码 **654项测试通过（145.893秒）**。测试期间140份范围内源码字节不变，38份预算/运行及暴露保护文件不变；没有市场访问。\n- [GitHub固定提交离线检查](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/actions/runs/40514396033)已完成，Python 3.10、3.11两个任务均成功；不替代独立验收。\n- 原未修改WR-23 MRE基线exit1、修复副本exit0；8专用及116相关方法通过。两个实际Windows进程竞争首次prepare结果一致，另两个竞争dispatch仅一个执行许可；首次旧夹具仅删marker造成的拒绝及真正旧四字段适配记录均保留。\n- 原未改WR-22 MRE对最终生产hash重放exit0，3合法控制保留。此前38方法、原13方法/43场景及新9方法/23场景在各自注明的较早hash通过，不能归给最终hash；最终追加2方法/4场景及最终654全量验证分开记录。\n- 早一版652方法全量通过后，开发侧实际确认“未知当前分类+全部liquidity缺失”仍可误过，因此保留原结果与原源码身份，收紧后重新冻结并全量验证。本次没有将先前通过冒充最终版通过。\n- 原真实失败包仅在隔离副本恢复15→17→17、重放17→17→17；缺dispatch/错cell拒绝，没有成功产物或新增费用。源迭代底层原因仍未知。\n- 元数据只读检查在最终更新及发布后均通过；447个发布blob原字节与本地相同，4530份未改基线文件原字节不变。开发者重放和各套件有重叠，不能累加为独有测试数或新独立批准。\n\n完整原ZIP SHA-256：`3eb0d548f2667c83c24e62f88495ae02fa2c8942440ce0c4aa665bb06b054753`。14165项原清单、14166个ZIP文件（含清单自身）及三个固定Git快照均核验。Git选择保留325份审核原件、用户粘贴原件及明确单列的6份开发归档材料；完整清单、重复源码、大tar/patch和两份非UTF-8输出仍在原ZIP，原路径/hash/省略规则明确，未转码或冒称全包副本。\n\n## 停止条件与剩余证据\n\n累计预算仍为配置 **7/12**、Research **10/20**、LEAN **1/16**。真实账本17事件、旧13前缀、经济配置及暴露事实不变；工程2/2/1停止门保持。本次QC、Research、LEAN、模型、部署、交易、购买和新市场配置登记均0，未调整上限或退款。\n\n实际云端执行仍为 `7fc5ef2e9d2379d29f48d05a1f3cc760000884d6`，本次候选未上云。本地与归档31份旧云端引用的28同/3异只是参考比较，不是当前平台读回或worker库存认证。\n\n真实Research/采集缓存/依赖LEAN成功联合链仍缺；旧worker具体差异未知；完整历史US200、财务版本及实际送达/摄入认证仍不足。阶段3–7未验收。PR保持草稿、未合并，正式研究、自动GPT、交易和最终测试关闭；2024–2025已暴露、2026独立性未知，financial_evidence=false。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:01Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"60b79c9ff690ff69f8bbf2eb89a4b6d24ff3e593","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"wwooyy429:feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","ref":"feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","repo":{"id":1433665311,"node_id":"R_kgDOVXP_Hw","name":"AQRP-LLM","full_name":"wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM","owner":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}